  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"agent-memory-system\" id=\"agent-memory-system\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufc4f3cfb\" id=\"ufc4f3cfb\">Memory System</span></h1><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%5Cn%2B%5Cn%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%A8%B3%E5%AE%9A%E6%80%A7%5Cn%2B%5Cn%E9%95%BF%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%E6%80%A7%5Cn%2B%5Cn%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%87%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eU0gO%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22SioVL%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"45d93c38\" id=\"45d93c38\"><span data-lake-id=\"uafd357e9\" id=\"uafd357e9\">一、记忆系统应该测哪几层</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"ud3afc617\" id=\"ud3afc617\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22Store%EF%BC%88%E8%AF%A5%E4%B8%8D%E8%AF%A5%E5%AD%98%EF%BC%89%5CnRecall%EF%BC%88%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E8%AE%B0%E8%B5%B7%E6%9D%A5%EF%BC%89%5CnConsolidation%EF%BC%88%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%9A%84%E7%86%B5%E5%A2%9E%EF%BC%9A%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E4%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E8%B6%8A%E6%9D%A5%E8%B6%8A%E4%B9%B1%EF%BC%89%5CnContext%20Assembly(%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%87%E7%BB%84%E8%A3%85%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%90%88%E7%90%86%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%9E%E8%B4%A8%E6%98%AFprompt%E8%B0%83%E4%BC%98%EF%BC%89%5CnGraph%20Expansion%EF%BC%88%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%90%88%E7%90%86%EF%BC%89%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x2z9C%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"9dbd49f3\" id=\"9dbd49f3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7d69e3b9\" id=\"u7d69e3b9\">二、五层评测体系</span></h1><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22RPUL0%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"pak4O\" id=\"pak4O\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9ec4b20a\" id=\"u9ec4b20a\">第一层：Store（该不该存）</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u6fd46d9c\" id=\"u6fd46d9c\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue10ebd5e\" id=\"ue10ebd5e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf189bb4c\" id=\"uf189bb4c\">评测目标</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u021f5107\" id=\"u021f5107\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3a53c024\" id=\"u3a53c024\">测试：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22Fact%20Extraction%5CnDedup%5CnImportance%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jsZal%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ue7078175\" id=\"ue7078175\"><span data-lake-id=\"u48200d19\" id=\"u48200d19\">是否正确。</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22UFka6%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u2fe135e1\" id=\"u2fe135e1\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u58a9513d\" id=\"u58a9513d\">首先还是要构建测试集</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u86d87ff5\" id=\"u86d87ff5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u00cf4807\" id=\"u00cf4807\">该不该记这个问题要基于你想让用户记什么？</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u699711a9\" id=\"u699711a9\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3694c334\" id=\"u3694c334\">对于我们这个agi系统我们考虑下面四点</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"uad919543\" id=\"uad919543\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc461c8b3\" id=\"uc461c8b3\">1. 是否长期稳定</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc88599af\" id=\"uc88599af\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u989a068c\" id=\"u989a068c\">2. 是否影响未来任务</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u24ee1585\" id=\"u24ee1585\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua9b88d02\" id=\"ua9b88d02\">3. 是否属于用户偏好/目标/技能</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u90758603\" id=\"u90758603\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u77cdfb73\" id=\"u77cdfb73\">4. 是否具有长期学习价值</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u46d87386\" id=\"u46d87386\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc7106804\" id=\"uc7106804\">​</span></strong><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u35f786b3\" id=\"u35f786b3\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u943892cc\" id=\"u943892cc\">真实测试集：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf88fe10e\" id=\"uf88fe10e\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"file\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fcsv%2F62181444%2F1779545729051-098118ca-33d0-437c-b95d-c24253bc1b41.csv%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22memory_store_eval_dataset_1000.csv%22%2C%22size%22%3A69937%2C%22ext%22%3A%22csv%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u612c7aa3-e962-4509-a6fa-1372bfc837d%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22text%2Fcsv%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22title%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u3c686ca1%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua4a06a35\" id=\"ua4a06a35\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uef28c405\" id=\"uef28c405\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u99be85c0\" id=\"u99be85c0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u600afc22\" id=\"u600afc22\">量化指标</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u52c4c0f4\" id=\"u52c4c0f4\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc9ca493a\" id=\"uc9ca493a\"> Memory Precision</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E8%AF%A5%E5%AD%98%E7%9A%84%20%2F%20%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E5%AD%98%E5%85%A5%E7%9A%84%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K8Z9w%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uc062b520\" id=\"uc062b520\"><span data-lake-id=\"u01e03887\" id=\"u01e03887\">tp+fp：该存的+不该存的</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf61a1038\" id=\"uf61a1038\"><span data-lake-id=\"u042c0414\" id=\"u042c0414\">fp：垃圾记忆，无价值记忆</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7a616b10\" id=\"u7a616b10\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4b831a3\" id=\"uf4b831a3\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0d3833cd\" id=\"u0d3833cd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u420d2681\" id=\"u420d2681\">Precision(清晰率）=tp/(tp+fp)</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8d202a2e\" id=\"u8d202a2e\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"udad06bec\" id=\"udad06bec\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9743c3f1\" id=\"u9743c3f1\">步骤：</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"oIGBs\" id=\"oIGBs\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3864b434\" id=\"u3864b434\">Step1</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uef74f0ab\" id=\"uef74f0ab\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6a01daea\" id=\"u6a01daea\">构建测试集</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"W8OOf\" id=\"W8OOf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5e9b9a64\" id=\"u5e9b9a64\">Step2</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u5b96ff23\" id=\"u5b96ff23\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud3637c7b\" id=\"ud3637c7b\">调用记忆系统封装好的逻辑功能函数</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue3be3560\" id=\"ue3be3560\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub7e4f00d\" id=\"ub7e4f00d\">memory.store()</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3822cd1c\" id=\"u3822cd1c\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf92f6b9f\" id=\"uf92f6b9f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2ec17381\" id=\"u2ec17381\">统计存入的所有记忆数量：（tp+fp）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua7ce021d\" id=\"ua7ce021d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua45d478b\" id=\"ua45d478b\">统计其中我们标注的应该被存入的记忆数量（tp）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufbcebc6a\" id=\"ufbcebc6a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0508521a\" id=\"u0508521a\">计算 Precision(清晰率）=tp/(tp+fp)</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u08e775b0\" id=\"u08e775b0\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc05c9d40\" id=\"uc05c9d40\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u94953b65\" id=\"u94953b65\"><span data-lake-id=\"uab696dec\" id=\"uab696dec\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u51c8217f\" id=\"u51c8217f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucbd5245c\" id=\"ucbd5245c\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub4d0292a\" id=\"ub4d0292a\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"PcUCo\" id=\"PcUCo\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua8631d60\" id=\"ua8631d60\">第二层：Recall（能不能记起来）</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uc541c933\" id=\"uc541c933\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf6ed76aa\" id=\"uf6ed76aa\">调用记忆系统封装好的逻辑功能函数</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u29f7fa2a\" id=\"u29f7fa2a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u11f2117c\" id=\"u11f2117c\">memory.recall()</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub117951a\" id=\"ub117951a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u14f56762\" id=\"u14f56762\">这里本质复用的还是RAG的检索逻辑，所以我们测的东西就是RAG测评里的检索的指标</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6cd3c6dc\" id=\"u6cd3c6dc\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"yuqueinline\" value=\"data:%7B%22mode%22%3A%22title%22%2C%22heightMode%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fyuqueyonghu-ng3vtk%2Fagi-saber%2Fkg90qoh7vm8o79bg%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fyuqueyonghu-ng3vtk%2Fagi-saber%2Fkg90qoh7vm8o79bg%3Fview%3Ddoc_embed%22%2C%22detail%22%3A%7B%22image%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F6218