"><span data-lake-id=\"u17c61dc2\" id=\"u17c61dc2\">例如：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22project%20memory%5Cnprofile%20memory%5Cntool%20memory%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MxeQq%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"VYA5P\" id=\"VYA5P\"><span data-lake-id=\"u49763326\" id=\"u49763326\">mrr</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ub6c3e5d9\" id=\"ub6c3e5d9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub6dac94f\" id=\"ub6dac94f\">低的话</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufca57594\" id=\"ufca57594\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2000c402\" id=\"u2000c402\">说明：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E6%8E%92%E5%BA%8F%E5%99%A8%E4%B8%8D%E8%A1%8C%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e01Xy%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u1742e45c\" id=\"u1742e45c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u02cf32ba\" id=\"u02cf32ba\">1. Rerank</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc93230b2\" id=\"uc93230b2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2cfce6f2\" id=\"u2cfce6f2\">调整重排系数</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7dd638e0\" id=\"u7dd638e0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6faf5960\" id=\"u6faf5960\">2. 时间衰减</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0849b6b7\" id=\"u0849b6b7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u415182e8\" id=\"u415182e8\">改变记忆片段的加权系数</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc7f80901\" id=\"uc7f80901\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud1ebb918\" id=\"ud1ebb918\">​</span></strong><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"qCo3O\" id=\"qCo3O\"><br></h3><h2 data-lake-id=\"zw7Wq\" id=\"zw7Wq\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2cbeedc4\" id=\"u2cbeedc4\">第三层：Consolidation（记忆的熵增：记忆会不会越来越乱）</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"awY7k\" id=\"awY7k\"><span data-lake-id=\"u826958c8\" id=\"u826958c8\">1:重复率</span></h3><h4 data-lake-id=\"cn2RV\" id=\"cn2RV\"><span data-lake-id=\"u92d8895d\" id=\"u92d8895d\">业界标准测试方法：时间轴模拟（Time-based Simulation）</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"uaa39422c\" id=\"uaa39422c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u857bf80e\" id=\"u857bf80e\">不是单轮测。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc1fd88e7\" id=\"uc1fd88e7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua3db493d\" id=\"ua3db493d\">而是：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufd0702a7\" id=\"ufd0702a7\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf5a52b98\" id=\"uf5a52b98\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0458722f\" id=\"u0458722f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u633c5c7c\" id=\"u633c5c7c\">模拟用户长期聊天</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3a281db3\" id=\"u3a281db3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8b7d7287\" id=\"u8b7d7287\">例如：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u43500b80\" id=\"u43500b80\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf39f4f1f\" id=\"uf39f4f1f\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub2be53df\" id=\"ub2be53df\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufa8460b6\" id=\"ufa8460b6\">1000轮</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uaea336cc\" id=\"uaea336cc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3220d99a\" id=\"u3220d99a\">5000轮</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u73309a9b\" id=\"u73309a9b\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf1cbffba\" id=\"uf1cbffba\">10000轮</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubbf59239\" id=\"ubbf59239\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5fb422c8\" id=\"u5fb422c8\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u245078a1\" id=\"u245078a1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u65b2f633\" id=\"u65b2f633\">然后观察：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uaa3b2496\" id=\"uaa3b2496\"><span data-lake-id=\"u95a6645a\" id=\"u95a6645a\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufab257dd\" id=\"ufab257dd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubfbf6ec2\" id=\"ubfbf6ec2\">记忆质量</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uade66383\" id=\"uade66383\"><span data-lake-id=\"u12749c94\" id=\"u12749c94\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u795f9f4a\" id=\"u795f9f4a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3ac24737\" id=\"u3ac24737\">持续运行 memory.store()，用脚本调用的时候记得记忆日期的填写</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud5977a1e\" id=\"ud5977a1e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufe377315\" id=\"ufe377315\">时间设置为每天存10轮，存100天；</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4f5e4703\" id=\"u4f5e4703\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3ab5169b\" id=\"u3ab5169b\">最后看存1000轮最后的数据；</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4a95ddd1\" id=\"u4a95ddd1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u10789447\" id=\"u10789447\">首先是重复率</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub8843243\" id=\"ub8843243\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufe9783b3\" id=\"ufe9783b3\">对最后剩余的所有记忆进行向量化，然后开始聚类，相似度大于90%视为重复</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uceb27512\" id=\"uceb27512\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4042207a\" id=\"u4042207a\">然后统计重复的记忆数量</span></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"QP004\" id=\"QP004\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9552ef11\" id=\"u9552ef11\">重复率=重复记忆/此时的所有记忆</span></h4><h3 data-lake-id=\"wGLcU\" id=\"wGLcU\"><span data-lake-id=\"u337920c5\" id=\"u337920c5\">记忆熵</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u90f35edc\" id=\"u90f35edc\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc992f905\" id=\"uc992f905\">方法</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9549f085\" id=\"u9549f085\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5d791c5c\" id=\"u5d791c5c\">对memory topic分布：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u75c7f22a\" id=\"u75c7f22a\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc90310a1\" id=\"uc90310a1\">做 entropy。</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nSUIO%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u8a278542\" id=\"u8a278542\"><span data-lake-id=\"u75c40c66\" id=\"u75c40c66\">举例</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22pVP5Z%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u1bf6e5c1\" id=\"u1bf6e5c1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud0ce5974\" id=\"ud0ce5974\">好系统</span><